entHeader__o71+-"><div>USPS Ground Advantage Channel Integration</div><div class="Documentation_subTitle__DvDQ-"><div>Last update time: 2026-02-10 14:31:45</div></div></div><div class="Documentation_contentBody__EIkfi"><div class="rocket-spin-nested-loading"><div class="rocket-spin-container"><div class="Documentation_section__UBqPB" style="min-height: 200px;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><h2 id="1._channel_overview"><p><span>1. Channel Overview</span></p></h2></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>Business Model</b></span><span>: Semi-Managed</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>Supported Site</b></span><span>: United States</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>Core Requirement</b></span><span>: Shipping labels must be purchased through the </span><span><b>Cooperative Warehouse Model</b></span><span>.</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><hr></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h2 id="2._prerequisite_configuration_(must_be_completed)"><p><span>2. Prerequisite Configuration (Must be Completed)</span></p></h2></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Ensure the following system configurations are completed before placing orders via API.</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h3 id="2.1_step_1:_authorize_a_cooperative_warehouse"><p><span>2.1 Step 1: Authorize a Cooperative Warehouse</span></p></h3></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>Operation Path</b></span><span>: Seller Central → [Global] → [Cooperative Warehouses] → [Warehouse Binding]</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>Description</b></span><span>: Complete authorization binding between your store and the designated cooperative warehouse.</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h3 id="2.2_step_2:_bind_product_relationships"><p><span>2.2 Step 2: Bind Product Relationships</span></p></h3></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Complete the binding between products on the TEMU platform and products in the authorized cooperative warehouse. Choose one of the following methods:</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><b>Method 1: Via API (Recommended)</b></span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ol start="1"><li><p><span><b>Push Binding Relationship</b></span></p></li></ol></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><li><p><span>API: </span><span><code>temu.cooperativewarehouse.skurelationship.create</code></span></p></li></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ol start="2"><li><p><span><b>Query Binding Result</b></span></p></li></ol></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><li><p><span>API: </span><span><code>temu.cooperativewarehouse.skurelationship.get</code></span></p></li></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><b>Method 2: Manual Operation via Seller Center</b></span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>Operation Path</b></span><span>: Seller Central → [Global] → [Cooperative Warehouses] → [Product Binding]</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><hr></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h2 id="3._order_placement_process_(api_call_sop)"><p><span>3. Order Placement Process (API Call SOP)</span></p></h2></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h3 id="3.1_step_1:_create_a_shipping_order_(place_order)"><p><span>3.1 Step 1: Create a Shipping Order (Place Order)</span></p></h3></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>API</b></span><span>: </span><span><code>bg.logistics.shipment.create</code></span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>Involved Channelid：</b></span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>    [34993000411136, 35513654317056, 40333435727872, 611945599262720, 627712098701312,</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>  630505264742400, 631214248140800, 631410211172352, 624813785726976, 623726291779584,</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>  624268683771904, 625166435418112, 604496950030336, 866160390584709120, 605419343069184,</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>  607416139603968, 922323761048190976, 626393018511360, 627315907997696, 922736394968629248,</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>  697277314813952, 697928790392832] </span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>Key Parameter Specifications</b></span><span>:</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true" style="overflow: auto;"><table><colgroup><col width="203" style="width: 203px;"><col width="215" style="width: 215px;"><col width="354" style="width: 354px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Parameter Name</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Value/Requirement</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Description</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><code>warehouseId</code></span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Authorized Warehouse ID</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Must be the ID of a cooperative warehouse authorized in </span><span><b>Step 2.1</b></span><span>.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><code>uspsMailingDateOffset</code></span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>1, 2, 3, 4</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Must be set to one of these four integer values.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><code>cooperativewarehouseshipment</code></span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><code>true</code></span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Must explicitly identify the shipment as from a cooperative warehouse.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><code>shipLater</code></span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><code>true</code></span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Must be set for delayed shipment.</span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h3 id="3.2_step_2:_retrieve_order_placement_result"><p><span>3.2 Step 2: Retrieve Order Placement Result</span></p></h3></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>API</b></span><span>: </span><span><code>bg.logistics.shipment.result.get</code></span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>Important Notes</b></span><span>:</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ol><ol start="1"><li><p><span><b>Key Indicator for Order Result</b></span><span>:</span></p></li></ol></ol></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><ul><li><p><span>Pass the cwFulfillNo field from the output of </span><span><b>bg.logistics.shipment.result.get</b></span><span> to </span><span><b>bg.cooperativewarehouse.fulfill.query</b></span><span> to query the cooperative warehouse order result</span></p></li></ul></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><ul><li><p><span>If the cooperative warehouse order fails, the system will</span><span><b> cancel​ </b></span><span>the label purchase for USPS Ground Advantage shipment.</span></p></li></ul></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><ul><li><p><span><b>Failure Handling</b></span><span>: Please call the </span><span><code>bg.logistics.shipment.update</code></span><span>API to re-initiate the order.</span></p></li></ul></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ol><ol start="2"><li><p><span><b>Disabled Functions</b></span><span>​ (Do NOT Call):</span></p></li></ol></ol></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><ul><li><p><span><b>Disabled</b></span><span>​ Label Printing API: </span><span><code>bg.logistics.shipment.document.get</code></span></p></li></ul></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><ul><li><p><span><b>Disabled</b></span><span>​ Manual Shipment Confirmation API: </span><span><code>bg.logistics.shipped.package.confirm</code></span></p></li></ul></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h3 id="3.3_step_3:_track_subsequent_fulfillment_status"><p><span>3.3 Step 3: Track Subsequent Fulfillment Status</span></p></h3></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>API</b></span><span>: </span><span><code>bg.cooperativewarehouse.fulfill.query</code></span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>Description</b></span><span>: After successful order placement, call this API to obtain the subsequent processing and outbound status of the package at the cooperative warehouse.</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>中文版</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h2 id="1._渠道概述"><p><span>1. 渠道概述</span></p></h2></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>业务模式</b></span><span>: 半托管</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>适用站点</b></span><span>: 美国</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>核心要求</b></span><span>: 使用USPS Ground Advantage 渠道需要通过</span><span><b>合作对接仓模式</b></span><span>购买平台面单进行发货</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><hr></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h2 id="2._前置配置_(必须完成)"><p><span>2. 前置配置 (必须完成)</span></p></h2></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>在通过接口下单前，请确保已完成以下系统配置。</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h3 id="2.1_第一步：授权合作对接仓"><p><span>2.1 第一步：授权合作对接仓</span></p></h3></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>操作路径</b></span><span>: Seller Central → 【全球】 → 【合作对接仓】 → 【仓库绑定】</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>说明</b></span><span>: 完成店铺与指定合作仓库的授权绑定。</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h3 id="2.2_第二步：绑定商品关系"><p><span>2.2 第二步：绑定商品关系</span></p></h3></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>完成TEMU平台商品与授权合作仓内商品的绑定。任选一种方式操作：</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><b>方式一：通过API接口 </b></span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ol start="1"><li><p><span><b>推送绑定关系</b></span></p></li></ol></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><li><p><span>接口: </span><span><code>temu.cooperativewarehouse.skurelationship.create</code></span></p></li></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ol start="2"><li><p><span><b>查询绑定结果</b></span></p></li></ol></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><li><p><span>接口: </span><span><code>temu.cooperativewarehouse.skurelationship.get</code></span></p></li></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><b>方式二：通过卖家中心手工操作</b></span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>操作路径</b></span><span>: Seller Central → 【全球】 → 【合作对接仓】 → 【商品绑定】</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><hr></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h2 id="3._下单流程_(接口调用sop)"><p><span>3. 下单流程 (接口调用SOP)</span></p></h2></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h3 id="3.1_第一步：创建物流单_(下单)"><p><span>3.1 第一步：创建物流单 (下单)</span></p></h3></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>接口</b></span><span>: </span><span><code>bg.logistics.shipment.create</code></span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>涉及渠道id：</b></span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>  [34993000411136, 35513654317056, 40333435727872, 611945599262720, 627712098701312,</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>  630505264742400, 631214248140800, 631410211172352, 624813785726976, 623726291779584,</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>  624268683771904, 625166435418112, 604496950030336, 866160390584709120, 605419343069184,</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>  607416139603968, 922323761048190976, 626393018511360, 627315907997696, 922736394968629248,</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>  697277314813952, 697928790392832] </span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>关键入参说明</b></span><span>:</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true" style="overflow: auto;"><table><colgroup><col width="261" style="width: 261px;"><col width="163" style="width: 163px;"><col width="312" style="width: 312px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>参数名</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>值/要求</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>说明</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><code>warehouseId</code></span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>已授权的仓库ID</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>必须为已完成</span><span><b>2.1</b></span><span>步骤授权的合作仓ID。</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><code>uspsMailingDateOffset</code></span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>1, 2, 3, 4</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>必须在此四个整数值中设置一个。</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><code>cooperativewarehouseshipment</code></span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><code>true</code></span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>必须明确标识为合作仓发货。</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><code>shipLater</code></span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><code>true</code></span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>必须设置为延迟发货。</span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h3 id="3.2_第二步：获取下单结果"><p><span>3.2 第二步：获取下单结果</span></p></h3></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>接口</b></span><span>: </span><span><code>bg.logistics.shipment.result.get</code></span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>关键注意事项</b></span><span>：</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ol><ol start="1"><li><p><span><b>下单结果核心判断</b></span><span>：</span></p></li></ol></ol></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><ul><li><p><span>通过</span><span><code>bg.logistics.shipment.result.get</code></span><span>出参中的 cwFulfillNo 字段，传入</span><span><code>bg.cooperativewarehouse.fulfill.query</code></span><span>查询合作仓下单结果。</span></p></li></ul></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><ul><li><p><span>若合作仓下单失败，系统将取消本次 USPS Ground Advantage面单购买。</span></p></li></ul></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><ul><li><p><span><b>失败处理</b></span><span>：请调用 </span><span><code>bg.logistics.shipment.update</code></span><span>接口重新发起下单。</span></p></li></ul></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ol><ol start="2"><li><p><span><b>禁用功能</b></span><span>​ (切勿调用)：</span></p></li></ol></ol></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><ul><li><p><span><b>禁用</b></span><span>​ 面单打印接口：</span><span><code>bg.logistics.shipment.document.get</code></span></p></li></ul></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><ul><ul><li><p><span><b>禁用</b></span><span>​ 手工发货确认接口：</span><span><code>bg.logistics.shipped.package.confirm</code></span></p></li></ul></ul></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h3 id="3.3_第三步：追踪后续履约状态"><p><span>3.3 第三步：追踪后续履约状态</span></p></h3></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>接口</b></span><span>: </span><span><code>bg.cooperativewarehouse.fulfill.query</code></span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><ul><li><p><span><b>说明</b></span><span>: 下单成功后，调用此接口以获取包裹在合作仓的后续处理与出库状态。</span></p></li></ul></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p></p></div></div></div></div></div></div>

