entHeader__o71+-"><div>TEMU Logistics Tracking API Documentation</div><div class="Documentation_subTitle__DvDQ-"><div>Last update time: 2025-09-22 17:25:08</div></div></div><div class="Documentation_contentBody__EIkfi"><div class="rocket-spin-nested-loading"><div class="rocket-spin-container"><div class="Documentation_section__UBqPB" style="min-height: 200px;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><h2 id="api_overview"><p><span>API Overview</span></p></h2></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><b>API Name</b></span><span>：</span><span><a href="https://partner-us.temu.com/documentation?menu_code=fb16b05f7a904765aac4af3a24b87d4a&amp;sub_menu_code=faaf5bb2612d481abeab5fc457903591">temu.track.trackinginfo.get</a></span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><b>Description</b></span><span>： Query logistics tracking information for TEMU platform orders</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span><b>Use Case</b></span><span>： Called when ERP system needs to obtain real-time logistics status of TEMU orders</span></p></div><div data-sabo-line="true"><h2 id="logistics_status_enumeration"><p><span>Logistics Status Enumeration</span></p></h2></div><div data-sabo-line="true" style="overflow: auto;"><table class="row-header"><colgroup><col width="250" style="width: 250px;"><col width="348" style="width: 348px;"><col width="371" style="width: 371px;"><col width="586" style="width: 586px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>group </span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>logistics Status </span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>State corresponds to event（中文）</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>State corresponds to event（EN）</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="22" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>In Transit</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Pre-shipment</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>预上网节点</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Initial scanning before the package is officially shipped and tracked by the carrier.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Manifest</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>尾程物流商的信息通知</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Information update provided by the final delivery carrier.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Manifest</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>尾程服务商生成的call label信息预报</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Advance information of a call label generated by the last-mile service provider.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>In transit by carrier</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>服务商交邮前的转运节点，例如交邮上网前的“卡转”等；是在尾程物流商官网无法查询到的节点内容</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Movement of goods before being handed to the postal service, usually not visible on the last-mile carrier's official tracking.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Local Logistics provider ask for an extra charge</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>尾程物流商向消费者收费</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The end delivery carrier requests an extra payment from the recipient.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>In transit</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>货物交邮后，到最后一公里派送点的一切非异常状态</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>All normal statuses after the goods are handed to the postal service until they reach the last-mile delivery point.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>In transit - Exception</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>货物从清关完成后，到尾程派送点的一切异常状态</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>All exception statuses occurring after customs clearance is completed and before reaching the last-mile delivery point.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Last Mile Carrier Picked up</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>尾程服务商首次揽收上网</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The initial pickup and scanning of the package by the last-mile service provider.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Pick up failed</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>取件失败，客户（例如半托管商家）跟揽收人说不寄了等揽收失败的情况</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The pickup attempt was unsuccessful (e.g., customer canceled the shipment).</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Inbound by Pick-up carrier</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>尾程段，货物进入揽收服务商仓库</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Goods have entered the warehouse of the pickup carrier in the last-mile segment.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Outbound by Pick-up carrier</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>尾程段，货物从揽收服务商仓库出库</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Goods have departed from the warehouse of the pickup carrier in the last-mile segment.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>In International Transit</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>半托管包裹跨国运输中</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>A semi-managed package is currently being transported across international borders.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Handed Over to Last-Mile</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>将包裹交付尾程服务商</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The package has been transferred to the final delivery service provider.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Manifest</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>非尾程服务商生成的call label信息预报</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Advance information of a call label that was not generated by the last-mile service provider.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Arrived at Departure Station</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>到达目的站台</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The goods have arrived at the destination terminal.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Picked up by Customs clearance company</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>清关前清关承运商提货(清关服务商回传的提货节点)</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Goods are collected by the customs clearance carrier before the customs clearance process begins.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Import Customs Clearance Success</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>进口清关完成放行</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Import customs procedures have been finished, and the goods are cleared for release.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Customs clearance Exception</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>清关延误</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>There is a hold-up or delay in the customs clearance process.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Import Customs Handover</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>清关承运商回传的货物交付节点</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The point at which goods are delivered, as reported back by the customs clearance carrier.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Picked up by Truck Carrier</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>清关放行后、尾程揽收前，卡转服务商提走货物</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>After customs release but before last-mile pickup, goods are taken by a truck transfer service provider.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Received at Destination Warehouse</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>半托管包裹转运到达目的仓库入库</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>A semi-managed package has been transferred and received into the destination warehouse.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>In transit after Customs Release</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>清关放行后、尾程揽收前的转运环节</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The movement of goods after they have been released by customs and before they are picked up for the last-mile delivery.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="10" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>In Delivery</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Arrived at Post Office </span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>货物到达尾程派送点</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The goods have reached the final delivery point (e.g., local post office or distribution center).</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Out for Delivery</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>货物从尾程派送点，到客户签收前的一切非异常状态</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>All non-exception statuses from the last-mile delivery point until before the customer's sign-off.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Delivery Exception</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>货物从尾程派送点，到客户签收前的一切非客户拒收的异常状态（不确定是否已尝试派送）</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>All exception statuses (excluding customer rejection) from the last-mile delivery point to before sign-off (uncertain if delivery attempted).</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Attempt Delivery</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>货物已经尝试送达客户，但不确定失败原因</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>A delivery attempt was made to the customer, but the specific reason for failure is not clear.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Delivery Failure</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>货物已经尝试送达客户，但客户拒绝、地址不详、电话联系不到等派送失败的状态</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Delivery was attempted but failed due to reasons like customer refusal, insufficient address, or inability to contact the recipient.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Delivery appointment confirmed</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>货物到达派送阶段后，用户要求指定时间或者更改地址派送</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>After the package reaches the delivery stage, a specific delivery time or address change is confirmed per customer request.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Delivery Failure-Carrier</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>由于服务商原因造成的派送失败，例如damage</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Delivery failed due to reasons attributable to the carrier, such as damage to the package.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Return to sender</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>包裹发生退件的场景</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The scenario where the package is being returned to the sender.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The undelivered package is returned and Available for Pickup</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>未妥投的包裹发生退件并送到海外仓附近自提点，等待仓库提取</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>An undelivered package is returned and placed at a pickup point near the overseas warehouse, awaiting retrieval by the warehouse.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Available for Pickup</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>货物送到自提点，等客户提取</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The goods have been delivered to a pickup point and are waiting for customer collection.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Delivered</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Delivered</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>签收状态</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The package has been successfully delivered and signed for by the recipient.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Delivery Failure</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Carrier accepted the claimed of Missing Parcel</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>包裹已经丢失，例如lost、stolen</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The package is confirmed to be lost or stolen.</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>The undelivered package is returned and delivered</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>未妥投的包裹发生退件并完成送达到海外仓，即“退件签收”</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>An undelivered package has been returned and successfully delivered to the overseas warehouse ("Return shipment signed for").</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" colspan="1" style="vertical-align: middle;"><div data-sabo-line="true"><p><span>Others</span></p></div></td><td rowspan="1" cols